WEBVTT

23:01.490 --> 23:05.911
The Hand was loved by all.
What sort of man would dare...

23:06.036 --> 23:08.747
I've heard it said that poison
is a woman's weapon.

23:08.872 --> 23:13.210
Yes, women, cravens...

23:13.335 --> 23:15.003
and eunuchs.

23:16.004 --> 23:19.299
Did you know that
Lord Varys is a eunuch?

23:19.424 --> 23:23.595
- Everybody knows that.
- Yes, yes, of course.

23:23.720 --> 23:26.431
How that sort of person
found himself

23:26.556 --> 23:30.560
- on the king's council, I will never know.
- I've taken enough of your time.
